" style="--k:2"><i class="aq-project-run__dot"></i><span class="aq-project-run__lab">Test</span></span><span class="aq-project-run__stop" style="--k:3"><i class="aq-project-run__dot"></i><span class="aq-project-run__lab">Qualify</span></span><span class="aq-project-run__stop" style="--k:4"><i class="aq-project-run__dot"></i><span class="aq-project-run__lab">Support</span></span></div></div><ol class="aq-project-run__steps"><li class="aq-project-run__step is-on" style="--k:0"><span class="aq-project-run__node" aria-hidden="true">01</span><span class="aq-illustration aq-illustration--ink aq-project-run__pic" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/illustrations/svc-design.webp);mask-image:url(assets/illustrations/svc-design.webp)"></span><div class="aq-project-run__text"><p class="aq-project-run__code" aria-hidden="true">01 / 05</p><h3 class="aq-project-run__t"><a href="#svc-design" data-wp="svc-design">Design</a></h3><p class="aq-project-run__d">We turn your user requirement specification (URS) into a design you approve before anything is built.</p></div></li><li class="aq-project-run__step" style="--k:1"><span class="aq-project-run__node" aria-hidden="true">02</span><span class="aq-illustration aq-illustration--ink aq-project-run__pic" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/illustrations/svc-fabrication.webp);mask-image:url(assets/illustrations/svc-fabrication.webp)"></span><div class="aq-project-run__text"><p class="aq-project-run__code" aria-hidden="true">02 / 05</p><h3 class="aq-project-run__t"><a href="#svc-fabrication" data-wp="svc-fabrication">Fabricate</a></h3><p class="aq-project-run__d">We build the PP skids and record each joint.</p></div></li><li class="aq-project-run__step" style="--k:2"><span class="aq-project-run__node" aria-hidden="true">03</span><span class="aq-illustration aq-illustration--ink aq-project-run__pic" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/illustrations/svc-fat-sat.webp);mask-image:url(assets/illustrations/svc-fat-sat.webp)"></span><div class="aq-project-run__text"><p class="aq-project-run__code" aria-hidden="true">03 / 05</p><h3 class="aq-project-run__t"><a href="#svc-fat-sat" data-wp="svc-fat-sat">Test</a></h3><p class="aq-project-run__d">A factory acceptance test (FAT) with water, to a protocol your quality unit approves.</p></div></li><li class="aq-project-run__step" style="--k:3"><span class="aq-project-run__node" aria-hidden="true">04</span><span class="aq-illustration aq-illustration--ink aq-project-run__pic" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/illustrations/svc-cq.webp);mask-image:url(assets/illustrations/svc-cq.webp)"></span><div class="aq-project-run__text"><p class="aq-project-run__code" aria-hidden="true">04 / 05</p><h3 class="aq-project-run__t"><a href="#svc-cq" data-wp="svc-cq">Qualify</a></h3><p class="aq-project-run__d">Site acceptance tests on your utilities, then installation and operational qualification (IQ/OQ) to protocols your quality unit approves.</p></div></li><li class="aq-project-run__step" style="--k:4"><span class="aq-project-run__node" aria-hidden="true">05</span><span class="aq-illustration aq-illustration--ink aq-project-run__pic" aria-hidden="true" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(assets/illustrations/svc-service.webp);mask-image:url(assets/illustrations/svc-service.webp)"></span><div class="aq-project-run__text"><p class="aq-project-run__code" aria-hidden="true">05 / 05</p><h3 class="aq-project-run__t"><a href="#svc-service" data-wp="svc-service">Support</a></h3><p class="aq-project-run__d">Performance qualification (PQ) support through 12 months of data, then service and spare parts.</p></div></li></ol></div></div></section></div>
